/**
 * Hand-curated condition tag vocabulary for the Related Videos Gallery
 * (2026-09-11 build spec, Section 4B). Deliberately not auto-derived from
 * each disease page's `conditions` prose list — those entries are full
 * sentences ("Vitiligo (Leucoderma / Safed Daag) — white patches on skin
 * due to melanocyte loss"), not a clean, predictable tag vocabulary an
 * admin can reliably type into a video's condition_tags when uploading —
 * same reasoning as the hand-curated navLabel map used elsewhere in this
 * project over a heuristic/auto-generated one.
 *
 * CATEGORY_VIDEO_TAG_CLUSTERS: for a category page (e.g. /skin-diseases),
 * the gallery shows every video tagged with ANY tag in that category's
 * cluster — the whole condition cluster, not just the category's own name.
 *
 * SUB_PAGE_VIDEO_TAG: for a specific sub-page (e.g.
 * /skin-diseases/vitiligo-treatment-jaipur), the gallery shows ONLY videos
 * tagged with that one exact condition tag — never the broader cluster.
 */

